{'symbol': 'WYNN', 'date': '2022-11-14 10:01:00', 'title': 'WYNN LAS VEGAS ANNOUNCES THE "OFFICIAL FORMULA 1 HEINEKEN SILVER LAS VEGAS GRAND PRIX MILLION DOLLAR ALL-ACCESS EXPERIENCE" IN PARTNERSHIP WITH F1®', 'text': 'THE FIRST-OF-ITS-KIND PACKAGE FEATURES EXCLUSIVE F1® AND RESORT ACCESS DURING THE INAUGURAL LAS VEGAS RACE $100K FROM EACH PACKAGE WILL BENEFIT LAS VEGAS PHILANTHROPIC EFFORTS LAS VEGAS , NOV. 14, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- FORMULA 1® (F1) AND FOUNDING PARTNER WYNN LAS VEGAS (NASDAQ: WYNN) HAVE PARTNERED TO CREATE THE "OFFICIAL FORMULA 1 HEINEKEN SILVER LAS VEGAS GRAND PRIX MILLION DOLLAR ALL-ACCESS EXPERIENCE" FOR THE INAUGURAL RACE TAKING PLACE NOV. 16-18, 2023. THE UNPRECEDENTED OFFERING WILL GIVE A GROUP OF SIX PEOPLE ONCE-IN-A-LIFETIME ACCESS TO NOT ONLY THE MOST EXCLUSIVE EVENTS HELD DURING THE GRAND PRIX™, BUT ALSO ONE-OF-A-KIND BESPOKE EVENTS AND ACTIVITIES.'}